WEBVTT

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:02.180
Did you see Aya?

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:03.560
Tamaki-kun, there's a reason for this.

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:05.940
Why didn't you tell me?!

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:12.860
Nii-chan!

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.380
Aya!

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:19.130
The inaugural concert is soon.

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:22.000
I need to stay focused.

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:29.440
Are you all right?

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:30.360
Are you hurt?

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:34.720
Please, take me to the TV station!

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:36.360
Please.

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:39.010
Otherwise, Tamaki-niichan will...

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:42.020
#14 Trigger

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.050
Nii-chan!

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:50.490
Nii-chan!

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:51.280
Aya!

00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:54.400
That's Tamaki-kun's little sister.

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.660
I'm happy for you, Tamaki-kun.

00:00:57.280 --> 00:00:58.410
His sister?

00:00:58.860 --> 00:01:01.080
I finally got to see you.

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:03.600
I'm so glad you're alive.

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:08.220
Nii-chan, how are you feeling?

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:10.280
They said a keychain made you sick.

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:13.270
That was So-chan's strategy to—

00:01:13.270 --> 00:01:14.520
I brought this.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:17.970
Eating these when you had 
a cold always made you feel better.

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:19.000
Aya...

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:24.260
Mom said they worked better for 
you than medicine from a doctor.

00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:26.520
So...

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:29.520
So, feel better.

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:33.430
Don't die. Don't die!

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:38.910
You dummy, I'm not going to die.

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:43.890
From now on, we'll always be together, Aya.

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:44.950
Nii-chan.

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:47.210
I'm so happy for Tamaki-san.

00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:48.860
Yeah.

00:01:49.430 --> 00:01:52.050
You guys cry so easily.

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:55.590
Amazing. What a beautiful sight.

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:58.990
From now on, the two of us can live together.

00:01:58.990 --> 00:02:02.100
I'm working as an idol now.

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:04.810
I've got money, so you don't need to worry.

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:08.550
What's wrong?

00:02:09.290 --> 00:02:12.820
I'm sorry. I can't live with you.

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:13.820
What?

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:15.970
What are you talking about?

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:20.160
I wanted to see for myself 
how you were doing.

00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:22.320
I don't need anything else.

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:24.310
You don't need to be shy about this.

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:26.110
From now on, I'll take care of—

00:02:26.110 --> 00:02:27.900
I have someone who takes care of me!

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:31.220
My new dad.

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:33.940
I'm living with him now.

00:02:33.940 --> 00:02:36.170
But I'm your <i>real</i> family.

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:40.170
I know that! But I want to stay with my dad.

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:42.050
I want to repay his kindness!

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:44.820
No! No one's gonna separate us again.

00:02:44.820 --> 00:02:46.300
Come with me, Aya!

00:02:47.590 --> 00:02:48.430
Let go of her.

00:02:49.490 --> 00:02:50.780
Tenn-oniichan.

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:53.300
"Tenn-oniichan"?

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:55.270
What's going on here?

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:57.760
Tenn Tenn, you're Rikkun's brother.

00:02:57.760 --> 00:02:58.690
Aya is my—

00:02:58.690 --> 00:03:00.400
That's in the past.

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:03.040
Now she's legally my younger sister.

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:03.910
Don't get violent.

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:05.410
You asshole!

00:03:05.690 --> 00:03:06.790
You're not making any—

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:09.580
No! Don't hurt Tenn-oniichan!

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:12.760
Aya, why?

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:15.100
I love you.

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:16.420
I missed you.

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:20.420
But I have a new family now.

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:24.860
He took care of my last foster father's debt.

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:26.930
He took care of me.

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:30.610
He gave me pretty clothes to wear.

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:33.480
He let me attend singing and 
dance lessons overseas.

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:36.270
Singing and dance lessons?

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:38.530
I'm going to become an idol.

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:40.400
One better than Zero.

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:41.720
An idol?

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:43.030
Better than Zero?

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:45.220
I may not be able to do it,

00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:49.730
but if training an idol who 
can surpass Zero is his dream,

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:52.540
then I want to try to meet his expectations.

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:53.920
Aya.

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:56.270
What does that even mean?

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:57.810
Who is—

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:04.840
A man who dreamed the same 
dream as Zero long ago.

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:06.140
You're...

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:07.720
Kujo.

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:10.150
Kujo-san!

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:11.900
You?

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:15.270
It's good to see you again, Miss.

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:26.160
I was Zero's manager and stage director.

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:28.300
Zero's manager?

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:30.200
Haw9-san?

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:35.000
Me, Zero, and Haruki.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:39.500
Back then, we believed that together 
we could make any dream come true.

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:41.420
You know Haruki?

00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:44.830
Zero's songs shone,

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:47.690
he soared beyond rainbows,

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:50.890
twinkling like stars in the night sky...

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:55.440
But Zero betrayed me.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:59.650
He left me in the middle 
of our dream and fled.

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:01.190
He didn't flee. Zero—

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:05.850
So I decided to create a legend
 greater than Zero's.

00:05:05.850 --> 00:05:09.220
Those were very difficult and sad days.

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:12.680
I traveled around the world 
in search of unpolished stars,

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:16.330
but no one could meet my expectations.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:21.760
Osaka Satoshi and Re:vale's Yuki refused 
to take the hand I extended to them.

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:25.590
They wasted the opportunity and 
failed to become first rate.

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:32.870
But I finally found children who 
would make my dream come true.

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:34.850
Talent to surpass Zero!

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:36.450
Tenn.

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:37.310
Yes.

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:38.740
Aya.

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:39.360
Yes.

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:45.110
These children are my last hope.

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:47.240
Tenn will surpass Zero?

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:49.700
That's why you were raised by Kujo?

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:51.190
That's right.

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:54.120
Ever since I became his foster child at 13.

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:55.580
No way.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.370
Why didn't you tell us before?

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:01.340
Let's go home, Kujo-san and Aya.

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:03.170
Okay, Onii-chan.

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:06.750
I'm sorry for leaving the house 
without your permission, Kujo-san.

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:09.480
It's all right. You're such a vivacious girl.

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:10.840
Wait!

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:12.590
You're going with him?

00:06:12.590 --> 00:06:13.560
Aya!

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:14.210
Kujo!

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:16.180
Riku.

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:18.440
It's been a while, Kujo.

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:19.910
You're...

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:27.190
Ah, you're that boy who could 
only hold Tenn's hand and cry.

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:28.740
I'm different now!

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.660
Tenn-nii, don't go with him!

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:35.500
He may have hurt Yuki-san's old partner 
in order to get his hands on him!

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:39.880
I had high hopes for Yuki and Re:vale.

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:41.960
I wouldn't pull any sinister tricks on them.

00:06:42.390 --> 00:06:44.970
I'm simply disappointed.

00:06:44.970 --> 00:06:49.650
If they had listened to me, Re:vale 
could have achieved perfection.

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:50.800
Perfection?

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:54.380
You mean a Re:vale that suits you.

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:58.270
The Re:vale Momo and I have 
built together is perfect.

00:06:58.270 --> 00:07:00.340
Don't push your ideals on us!

00:07:00.340 --> 00:07:00.890
Yuki.

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:05.410
You're different, but the boy standing 
beside you is second rate.

00:07:05.410 --> 00:07:10.530
Standing next to a second-rate 
idol dulls the shine of a star.

00:07:10.970 --> 00:07:14.520
What a shame. You could've 
shone brighter, Yuki.

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:15.780
I...

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:20.040
I applaud your desire to take on Zero.

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:24.180
However, you won't be the ones 
to create a new legend.

00:07:24.180 --> 00:07:26.420
I shall create it with my own two hands!

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:27.430
You're wrong.

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:30.520
There's no place for you in the new era.

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:33.250
You're nothing more than a ghost of the past.

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:38.520
The legend that will surpass Zero will 
be created by myself and our manager.

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:40.020
I-Iori-san?

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:45.190
She and I will turn IDOLiSH7 
into idols greater than Zero.

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:46.690
Iori.

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:49.320
Right, Manager?

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:55.980
Yes. The group who will surpass Zero and 
become a new legend is my IDOLiSH7.

00:07:57.600 --> 00:07:59.140
What an interesting girl.

00:07:59.140 --> 00:07:59.750
What's your name?

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:04.630
Takanashi Productions' manager 
for IDOLiSH7, Takanashi Tsumugi.

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:06.980
I'll remember you.

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:09.640
Tenn. Aya. Let's go.

00:08:09.640 --> 00:08:11.110
Okay, Kujo-san!

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:12.510
Wait!

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.760
Move! Do you want to get knocked on your ass?

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:16.990
If you're going to hit me,
 try to avoid my face.

00:08:16.990 --> 00:08:18.030
I don't give a—

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:18.430
Wait!

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:19.430
Stop!

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:22.110
He's our center.

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:24.190
Whatever the reason, 
I won't let you hurt him.

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:26.680
Sorry. Could you let this go for now?

00:08:26.680 --> 00:08:29.130
Tenn, let's talk once 
things have settled down.

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:33.450
See you later, IDOLiSH7's manager.

00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:37.230
Damn it!

00:08:38.670 --> 00:08:39.600
Tenn-nii...

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:45.150
Aya's being tricked by him.

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:47.080
I'll get her back.

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:51.070
It sounded like Kujo-san knew my uncle.

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:54.200
He said my uncle "failed 
to become first-rate."

00:08:55.540 --> 00:09:00.100
Either way, you and I have a common enemy now.

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:01.620
Seems that way.

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:04.060
I'm not sure he's really our enemy, though.

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:05.440
Of course he is!

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:08.850
If not for him, we could've lived together.

00:09:08.850 --> 00:09:11.530
Yuki-san's partner wouldn't 
have gone missing,

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:14.440
and Aya-chan would've gone home to Tamaki.

00:09:16.730 --> 00:09:20.760
His dream to create another 
Zero and surpass him

00:09:21.170 --> 00:09:23.000
is tearing people away from each other.

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:26.980
You're right. His dream frightens me a little.

00:09:26.980 --> 00:09:29.200
It's okay! Don't worry.

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:31.710
I'll defeat him.

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:32.920
Defeat him?

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:35.420
Sounds like something you'd say.

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:36.840
Why are you guys laughing?

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:41.180
I was just thinking I like how 
childish but dependable you are.

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:43.330
I'm counting on you, Tamaki-kun.

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:48.700
Well, I guess I can forgive you for now.

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:49.190
Huh?

00:09:49.430 --> 00:09:52.190
I won't disband MEZZO".

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:53.690
Really?!

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:56.790
Since you're so insistent I don't.

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:58.430
I do insist!

00:09:58.430 --> 00:10:00.650
I'm so glad. Thank you.

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:05.200
I'll be more careful from now on 
so that we can get along better.

00:10:05.930 --> 00:10:08.390
I look forward to working with you.

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:15.240
I can't believe you're the same 
guy who broke down my door.

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:19.060
The man who raised Zero...

00:10:19.060 --> 00:10:22.300
Zero's manager, Kujo Takamasa.

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:25.380
He called Zero a traitor.

00:10:25.380 --> 00:10:28.440
Did Zero vanish without saying 
anything to his manager?

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:33.980
If that's the case, then it disproves 
the theory that Zero went crazy.

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:35.190
How?

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:41.290
If he really was hospitalized, his manager 
would have known which hospital he ended up at.

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:42.460
I see.

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:44.770
It's odd, though.

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:50.490
Kujo searched for his replacement, 
while Sakura Haruki searched for Zero.

00:10:50.970 --> 00:10:54.540
The people closest to Zero took 
completely different actions.

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:58.220
Haruki loved Zero.

00:10:58.220 --> 00:11:02.800
But it's possible that Mr. Kujo hates Zero.

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:05.810
Manager, what would you do?

00:11:05.810 --> 00:11:06.470
What?

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:10.890
If we suddenly vanished, I mean.

00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:13.560
Would you look for us?

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:17.900
Would you resent us and 
search for our replacements?

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:22.700
I... I think I'd look for you.

00:11:23.130 --> 00:11:26.920
I couldn't entrust the dream we 
imagined together to someone else.

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:30.650
I do think it would be 
quite the shock, though.

00:11:30.650 --> 00:11:34.460
If you suddenly vanished, 
I doubt I could get over it.

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:36.280
It's just a hypothetical.

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:37.920
We're not going anywhere.

00:11:38.470 --> 00:11:39.970
Promise me you won't.

00:11:40.460 --> 00:11:44.470
I know I'm always causing trouble 
for you, but I'll do my very best.

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:49.210
Please don't suddenly vanish like Zero did.

00:11:53.090 --> 00:11:56.730
Iori-san, could I have a few 
minutes of your time?

00:11:57.370 --> 00:11:58.500
Sure.

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:01.080
Welcome back, everyone.

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:03.030
You all seem exhausted.

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:07.210
Yes. A lot happened.

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:10.380
Are TRIGGER and Re:vale all right?

00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:13.630
Especially Re:vale. They're still 
dealing with Momo-san's problem.

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:15.620
Did something happen to Momo-kun?

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:16.540
Actually—

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:20.770
Banri, you previously mentioned 
you're a Re:vale fan.

00:12:20.770 --> 00:12:22.590
Did you know them in their indie days, too?

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:24.740
Yeah, I did...

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:28.250
Really? Then do you know about 
Yuki-san's previous partner?

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:29.720
Previous partner?

00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:32.520
Momo-san can't sing anymore.

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:35.030
What?! Why not?

00:12:35.030 --> 00:12:40.080
We don't know the cause, but we think it 
might be because of Yuki-san's old partner.

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:40.650
What?

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:42.810
It's not his fault.

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:46.380
Yuki-san is looking for his old partner.

00:12:46.380 --> 00:12:52.820
Momo-san mistakenly believed Yuki-san would 
make him quit Re:vale if he found him.

00:12:52.820 --> 00:12:56.860
Then wouldn't it be best if he's not found?

00:12:56.860 --> 00:12:58.670
It's complicated.

00:12:58.900 --> 00:13:02.770
If Yuki-san finds his partner, 
he might get over it.

00:12:58.900 --> 00:13:06.680
<b>Former Partner</b>

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:06.680
If Yuki-san gets over it, then Momo-san 
might get over his own issues, too.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:10.380
The Re:vale boys seem so close.

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:12.300
I thought things were going well with them.

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:14.860
No. It's one problem after another.

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:18.080
If you know anything, could you tell us?

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:20.690
Anything helps. Please.

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:23.380
Got it.

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:26.820
For now, we need to find 
his old partner, right?

00:13:27.310 --> 00:13:31.570
Why did you say we'd surpass Zero?

00:13:31.570 --> 00:13:36.580
Because I believe we can, as long as 
we have our current members and you.

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:37.500
What?

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:40.630
Don't you think we make a good team?

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:44.050
A team? You and I?

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:47.320
IDOLiSH7's management team.

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:52.310
You or I alone couldn't have 
created the current IDOLiSH7.

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:57.080
Together, don't you think 
we can surpass Zero?

00:13:57.580 --> 00:13:58.310
Iori-san.

00:13:58.680 --> 00:14:00.600
"My IDOLiSH7."

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:02.330
That's what you called us.

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:05.440
I'm sorry! I didn't mean mine personally—

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:09.860
I like how it sounds when 
you call us "my IDOLiSH7."

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:17.000
It makes me want to become yours, act as your 
weapon, and make your dream come true.

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:22.360
The dream Zero, Kujo, and 
Sakura Haruki failed to reach.

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:23.380
The dream...

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:33.560
Take a look at this.

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:36.940
This sight is like a dream.

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:42.080
<i>They're about to make history 
in the new Zero Arena.</i>

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:44.570
It's time.

00:14:47.050 --> 00:14:48.640
Tenn, have a seat.

00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:50.700
No way. My outfit will get wrinkled.

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:52.450
We need to talk.

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:53.120
No.

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:54.830
You brat.

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:57.810
We haven't had the chance to talk 
because you've been avoiding us.

00:14:57.810 --> 00:15:00.220
You think we can perform like this?!

00:15:00.220 --> 00:15:01.300
Cut it out.

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:03.890
And Tenn, don't be like that.

00:15:03.890 --> 00:15:06.340
Gaku and I are worried about you.

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:07.590
Ryu...

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:09.910
I just have some questions.

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:12.220
I don't care about you surpassing Zero.

00:15:13.810 --> 00:15:17.660
What do you think of TRIGGER? Of us?

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:19.600
Are we just business partners?

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:21.520
A group you can leave anytime?

00:15:22.930 --> 00:15:24.560
I thought I told you before.

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:25.760
Tell me <i>now!</i>

00:15:25.760 --> 00:15:26.320
Gaku.

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:30.900
I think of you as my f-friends.

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:34.510
Tenn, could you turn
up your volume a little more?

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:38.080
I think of you as my friends.

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:41.220
I see!

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:42.570
Glad to hear it, Tenn.

00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:43.830
Isn't that great, Gaku?

00:15:44.100 --> 00:15:46.130
Yeah. That's what I wanted to hear.

00:15:46.640 --> 00:15:47.630
Gaku.

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:52.630
No matter what burdens you carry, 
we're TRIGGER. We all share the same fate.

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:57.390
If you'll become a legend, 
we'll be your trigger.

00:15:57.610 --> 00:15:59.160
We'll protect you.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:03.230
Let's show the whole damn 
world what we can do.

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:06.340
You're so embarrassing.

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:10.720
The threatening letter and Zero 
have nothing to do with us.

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:14.780
Let's deliver the ultimate musical 
to our fans who have come to see us.

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:15.780
Yeah!

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:17.030
Of course.

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:18.110
All right!

00:16:18.110 --> 00:16:19.780
Let's go, TRIGGER!

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:33.380
<i>The musical starring TRIGGER,</i>

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:38.810
<i></i>Last Dimension: Who Will Pull 
the Trigger?<i>, will now begin.</i>

00:16:41.320 --> 00:16:42.640
You will choose.

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:44.520
You will choose the present.

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:48.400
Your choice will determine 
the past and the future.

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:50.300
You will hesitate.

00:16:50.300 --> 00:16:52.000
You will hesitate over the present.

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:55.780
Your hesitation will confuse 
the past and defy the future.

00:16:56.390 --> 00:16:58.540
Who will pull the trigger?

00:17:08.610 --> 00:17:10.590
Do as I say!

00:17:18.650 --> 00:17:21.430
Forcing your way just proves
 your own loneliness.

00:17:22.860 --> 00:17:27.230
I didn't want to be chosen by anyone.

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:39.910
Thank you all so much!

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:41.660
We hope you'll watch our movie, too!

00:17:41.940 --> 00:17:44.500
And watch IDOLiSH7's concert tomorrow!

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:48.330
Wow!

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:50.210
Tenn is impressive.

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:52.880
The other two are rather talented, too.

00:17:56.070 --> 00:17:58.630
It reminds me of the past.

00:18:01.520 --> 00:18:04.390
Man... TRIGGER was amazing.

00:18:04.740 --> 00:18:09.050
Are you sure you didn't need 
to go say hello to TRIGGER?

00:18:09.050 --> 00:18:11.340
I'm sure they're busy with their cast party.

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:13.820
And besides, we need to prep for tomorrow.

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:14.700
Excuse me.

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:18.940
You're IDOLiSH7's Mitsuki-san, right?

00:18:18.940 --> 00:18:20.160
Er, yes.

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:22.610
I knew it! I'm a fan.

00:18:22.610 --> 00:18:24.080
Good luck tomorrow!

00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:26.500
Thank you.

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:32.110
Um, hey, please don't let
 things bother you.

00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:37.080
After all, I've been your fan 
since before you started MCing!

00:18:38.990 --> 00:18:40.930
Th-Thank you.

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:43.600
It's IDOLiSH7!

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:45.850
Seriously?

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:48.220
Don't let the Zero scandal bring you down!

00:18:48.220 --> 00:18:51.350
My entire family in on IDOLiSH7's side.

00:18:51.590 --> 00:18:53.360
Iori-kun, good luck!

00:18:51.590 --> 00:18:53.360
Mitsuki-kun, good luck!

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:54.370
Hi.

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:55.020
Guys.

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:57.360
I watch the MEZZO" drama every week.

00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:58.890
I'm excited to see what happens next!

00:18:58.890 --> 00:19:00.400
Thank you.

00:19:00.400 --> 00:19:01.950
Thank you.

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:04.840
Yamato-san, I hope you'll 
appear in another drama.

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:06.450
My husband supports you, too.

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:07.630
Thanks.

00:19:07.630 --> 00:19:08.850
Ready, and...

00:19:08.850 --> 00:19:11.520
Nagi, we love you!

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:13.590
Oh. Me, too!

00:19:13.870 --> 00:19:15.350
Good luck!

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:17.210
Riku-kun, Iori-kun!

00:19:18.910 --> 00:19:21.630
Please don't fight.

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:22.640
What?

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:27.680
It's not official, but I maintain 
a fansite for you two!

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:28.470
<b>IDOLiSH7 
<Unofficial> 
Iori and Riku Fansite</b>

00:19:28.660 --> 00:19:29.680
<b>IDOLiSH7 
<Unofficial> 
Iori and Riku Fansite</b>

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:35.150
I've been a fan ever 
since your first concert.

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:39.380
I thought the concert you performed the day

00:19:39.380 --> 00:19:41.670
the trains were stopped
 was especially amazing.

00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:45.590
The way Iori-kun showed consideration 
for Riku-kun and supported him

00:19:45.590 --> 00:19:48.910
while singing was really nice.

00:19:49.210 --> 00:19:52.460
No matter who's the center, 
I love both of you!

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:54.410
Keep supporting each other
 like you did that day.

00:19:54.410 --> 00:19:55.940
Don't let the critics bring you down.

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:57.800
Zero doesn't matter!

00:19:57.800 --> 00:20:00.500
Be yourselves! Good luck!

00:20:02.020 --> 00:20:05.160
Thanks. We'll do our best tomorrow!

00:20:06.320 --> 00:20:07.030
Yeah!

00:20:19.210 --> 00:20:21.780
Guys, thanks for tonight!

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:27.160
Thanks to all of you, we've had 
an awesome night!

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:32.920
I know we've made you worry a lot, but 
we hope you'll continue to support us!

00:20:35.850 --> 00:20:40.520
I was asked to do this before, but 
I was too embarrassed to do it.

00:20:40.930 --> 00:20:41.670
Iori.

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:42.070
What?

00:20:42.070 --> 00:20:43.390
Give me your hand.

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:44.590
Are we doing this?

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:47.010
Yeah. So will MEZZO", right?

00:20:47.260 --> 00:20:48.050
Sure.

00:20:48.050 --> 00:20:50.010
What about the alien being arrested, though?

00:20:50.230 --> 00:20:51.610
Shut up.

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:53.800
Let's do this.

00:20:57.530 --> 00:20:58.770
Ready, and...

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:01.700
Thank you very much!

00:21:07.710 --> 00:21:09.470
Momo, are you okay?

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:16.410
If I can't sing in front of an audience 
this big tomorrow, my career is over.

00:21:16.410 --> 00:21:19.760
Then you can look for a new partner.

00:21:19.760 --> 00:21:21.300
Don't be ridiculous!

00:21:21.740 --> 00:21:24.120
Even if I can't sing, let me stay with you.

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:26.270
There was that threatening letter.

00:21:26.270 --> 00:21:27.140
Momo...

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:30.640
If anything happens, I'll be your shield.

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:32.100
What are you talking about?

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:37.700
Singing with you for five years 
made me so happy I could die.

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:39.280
Cut it out, Momo!

00:21:39.280 --> 00:21:40.770
You'll be able to sing.

00:21:42.170 --> 00:21:43.200
Thanks.

00:21:51.390 --> 00:21:55.170
I don't want to lose another partner.

00:21:52.640 --> 00:21:57.870
(If you get lost, there's a song here)

00:21:56.420 --> 00:22:02.370
If the reason he can't sing isn't 
poison or stress, then it must be <i>me</i>.

00:21:58.790 --> 00:22:04.050
(If you get lost, there's a song here)

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:09.760
We came to understand a brilliant something

00:22:10.370 --> 00:22:15.980
resembling all the light in the galaxy

00:22:16.530 --> 00:22:28.360
Even on days I'm scared, the faint 
warmth I want to deliver won't disappear

00:22:28.360 --> 00:22:34.580
Even if you want to close your 
eyes to reality's reflection

00:22:34.580 --> 00:22:40.150
Come on, let's create an illusion

00:22:40.150 --> 00:22:42.670
The sound of the future

00:22:43.600 --> 00:22:46.820
On the curtain of three thousand worlds

00:22:46.820 --> 00:22:49.920
We quietly adorn

00:22:49.920 --> 00:22:55.190
Each and every one of us has meaning

00:22:55.890 --> 00:22:59.200
It's the message of the Fantasia

00:22:59.200 --> 00:23:03.720
You're the one who gave 
me the courage to weave

00:23:03.720 --> 00:23:09.030
So I always want you by my side

00:23:19.680 --> 00:23:24.090
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:26.300 --> 00:23:29.400
I told you not to come in 
here without my permission.

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:32.370
What are you doing, Yamato-kun?

00:23:32.370 --> 00:23:33.530
What did you put in that?

00:23:33.530 --> 00:23:34.840
What are you talking about?

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:36.820
Momo only drinks that juice.

00:23:36.820 --> 00:23:38.910
Everyone close to him knows that.

00:23:44.300 --> 00:23:45.940
What's the meaning of this?

00:23:46.410 --> 00:23:50.970
I told you. I'm here for revenge.

00:23:50.970 --> 00:23:52.200
Revenge?

00:23:52.510 --> 00:23:54.710
"Get back my song."

00:23:54.710 --> 00:23:59.120
I won't forgive anyone who 
encroaches on Zero's territory.
